  "preset_version": 1,
  "display_name": "Storybook painterly",
  "description": "First preset: a warm, handmade toy diorama. Soft bounced light, gently desaturated colour that shifts with the hour and the season, crisp detail within the player's reach and a soft far room. DRAFT (Run 1, Look lane): tuned on the placeholder room against docs/look/LOOK-BIBLE.md; not yet submitted for the look gate, so it may still change in place.",
  "status": "draft",
  "look_bible": "docs/look/LOOK-BIBLE.md",
